{"synopsis":"Sepanjang sejarah, banyak legenda beredar tentang keberadaan alam spiritual. Keyakinan ini diperdebatkan sama banyak cendekiawan dari berbagai dinasti, termasuk satu puisi yang bilang: ‘Dari dinasti Qi sampai Tang, gunung ini tandus dan sepi, alam spiritual sunyi dan jarang dikunjungi. Alam spiritual enggak bisa dijelasin, dan bahkan jejak kerjaan hantu pun susah dicari.’","alternative_title":"Lingjing Xingzhe, Língjìng Xíngzhě, Mystic Domain, Spirit Realm Walker, Spiritual Realm Walker, 灵境行者","author":"Yingzhiyao","artist":"Yingzhiyao","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"76e76c88-debe-49bd-b166-2053154d5dc1","number":"60","chapter":"60","title":"","date":"2026-07-22","released":"2026-07-22","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ba2ee3ea-d540-496b-8480-0afaa3ae07e0/chapter_ch_1/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ba2ee3ea-d540-496b-8480-0afaa3ae07e0/chapter_ch_2/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ba2ee3ea-d540-496b-8480-0afaa3ae07e0/chapter_ch_3/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ba2ee3ea-d540-496b-8480-0afaa3ae07e0/chapter_ch_4/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ba2ee3ea-d540-496b-8480-0afaa3ae07e0/chapter_ch_5/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ba2ee3ea-d540-496b-8480-0afaa3ae07e0/chapter_ch_6/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ba2ee3ea-d540-496b-8480-0afaa3ae07e0/chapter_ch_7/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ba2ee3ea-d540-496b-8480-0afaa3ae07e0/chapter_ch_8/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ba2ee3ea-d540-496b-8480-0afaa3ae07e0/chapter_ch_9/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ba2ee3ea-d540-496b-8480-0afaa3ae07e0/chapter_ch_10/10.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ba2ee3ea-d540-496b-8480-0afaa3ae07e0/chapter_ch_11/11.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ba2ee3ea-d540-496b-8480-0afaa3ae07e0/chapter_ch_12/12.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ba2ee3ea-d540-496b-8480-0afaa3ae07e0/chapter_ch_13/13.webp","https://assets.